    modified_response: "I will create `/src/components/ProcessEditorView.tsx` to edit the production process details. The component uses a horizontal tab bar corresponding to the 4 rubrics: Internal Equipment (calculator for gasoil, parts, depreciation), Rented Equipment, Personnel (payroll, meals, lodging), and Process-Specific Taxes. \n\nEach tab shows a listing of resources with direct edit/delete controls and a clean creation form. The forms support both detailed calculative inputs (e.g. hours \303\227 hourly consumption \303\227 price/liter) and quick total cost overrides for maximal flexibility."
