    modified_response: "I will now write the main application code inside `/src/App.tsx`. \n\nThis includes:\n1. **Dynamic State Management**: Handles the active scenario, selected period (monthly vs annual), currency selection, total production tonnage, and average selling price.\n2. **Top Utility Bar**: Allows updating key variables instantly (such as production tonnage, average price per tonne, and currency). It features a \"Global Gasoil Sync\" tool that instantly propagates fuel price modifications across all machinery inside all five processes.\n3. **Desktop ERP Sidebar Layout**: Elegant left panel for smooth switching between the main Dashboard, the five detailed production rubrics, and the Scenario/Database Manager. It adapts elegantly on tablets and mobile screens.\n4. **Interactive Calculation Engine**: Connects all state updates live so that changing any engine hour, daily meal rate, or extraction tax instantly recalculates the entire quarry cost price, sales, and profit margin in real time.\n5. **Print & PDF Layout Styles**: Tailors a clean, high-contrast printing layout using media queries so that the user can print professional cost reports directly."
