    user_response: "Apply the \"Bold Typography\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Bold Typography\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-zinc-950 text-white font-sans flex flex-col overflow-hidden p-6 border-8 border-zinc-900\\\">\\n  <!-- TOP HEADER / GLOBAL METRICS -->\\n  <header class=\\\"flex justify-between items-end mb-8 border-b border-zinc-800 pb-4\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <h1 class=\\\"text-6xl font-black tracking-tighter leading-none\\\">QUARRY_CORE<span class=\\\"text-emerald-500\\\">.v1</span></h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"text-zinc-500 font-mono text-sm uppercase mt-2\\\">Systeme de Calcul de Prix de Revient Industriel</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-8 text-right\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase font-bold\\\">Cout Total / Tonne</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-5xl font-black text-emerald-400\\\">14.82 \342\202\254</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase font-bold\\\">Volume Mensuel</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-5xl font-black\\\">45,000 <span class=\\\"text-xl\\\">T</span></p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"flex flex-1 gap-6 min-h-0\\\">\\n    <!-- SIDE NAVIGATION: PROCESS SELECTION -->\\n    <nav class=\\\"w-64 flex flex-col gap-2\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-emerald-500 text-black p-4\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase mb-1\\\">Active Process</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-2xl font-black leading-none uppercase\\\">01. FRONT DE TAILLE</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-zinc-900 p-4 opacity-50 border-l-4 border-transparent\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-zinc-500 uppercase mb-1 underline\\\">Inactive</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xl font-bold leading-none uppercase\\\">02. TRANSPORT</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-zinc-900 p-4 opacity-50 border-l-4 border-transparent\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-zinc-500 uppercase mb-1 underline\\\">Inactive</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xl font-bold leading-none uppercase\\\">03. CONCASSAGE</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-zinc-900 p-4 opacity-50 border-l-4 border-transparent\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-zinc-500 uppercase mb-1 underline\\\">Inactive</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xl font-bold leading-none uppercase\\\">04. CHARGEMENT</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-zinc-900 p-4 opacity-50 border-l-4 border-transparent\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-zinc-500 uppercase mb-1 underline\\\">Inactive</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xl font-bold leading-none uppercase\\\">05. MOYENS GENERAUX</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <!-- MAIN DASHBOARD CONTENT -->\\n    <main class=\\\"flex-1 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\\\">\\n      <!-- CONSUMABLES SECTION -->\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-zinc-900 p-5 flex flex-col justify-between border-t-2 border-emerald-500\\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-black text-emerald-500 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Consommation Energie</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"mt-4\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-4xl font-black italic\\\">4,250.00 \342\202\254</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mt-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs text-zinc-400\\\">GASOIL (3,800 L)</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"h-[2px] flex-1 mx-4 bg-zinc-800\\\"></span>\\n            <span class=\\\"font-mono text-sm\\\">92%</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mt-1\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs text-zinc-400\\\">LUBRIFIANTS</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"h-[2px] flex-1 mx-4 bg-zinc-800\\\"></span>\\n            <span class=\\\"font-mono text-sm\\\">08%</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- SPARE PARTS SECTION -->\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-zinc-900 p-5 flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-black text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Pi\303\250ces & Maintenance</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"mt-4\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-4xl font-black italic\\\">1,840.00 \342\202\254</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-zinc-500 mt-2 leading-tight uppercase font-bold\\\">\\n         